title The line through the middle
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  caption This line cuts the field in half.
  draw halfway-line
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is that called?
  answer Halfway line
  wrong Goal line
  wrong Sideline
  wrong Penalty area
  correct Halfway line.
  why The halfway line splits the field into two halves. At kick-off, each team starts in their own half.
